# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# QS-VC On-Premises Configuration Template
# Copy to config/.env and configure for your intranet environment
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# General Deployment Mode
NODE_ENV=production
QSVC_DEPLOYMENT=onprem
QSVC_PUBLIC_URL=https://meet.internal

# Platform Administrator Emails (Comma-separated, REQUIRED in on-prem mode)
QSVC_ADMIN_EMAILS=admin@internal.org

# Database (PostgreSQL)
POSTGRES_HOST=postgres
POSTGRES_PORT=5432
POSTGRES_DB=qsvc
POSTGRES_USER=qsvc
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=CHANGE_ME_POSTGRES_PASSWORD_2026

# Redis (Session & pub/sub cache)
REDIS_HOST=redis
REDIS_PORT=6379
REDIS_PASSWORD=CHANGE_ME_REDIS_PASSWORD_2026

# JWT Authentication
JWT_SECRET=CHANGE_ME_JWT_SECRET_AT_LEAST_32_CHARACTERS_LONG_2026
JWT_EXPIRY=24h

# Optional external payment checkout. Leave disabled for offline/air-gapped sites.
# Provider webhooks require a public HTTPS callback reachable from the provider.
PAYMENTS_ENABLED=false
PAYMENT_TERMS_CONFIRMED=false
PAYMENT_RETURN_URL=https://meet.internal
AUTH_PUBLIC_URL=
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=
RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
RAZORPAY_PLAN_STARTER=
RAZORPAY_PLAN_PRO=
PAYPAL_ENVIRONMENT=sandbox
PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID=
PAYPAL_CLIENT_SECRET=
PAYPAL_WEBHOOK_ID=
PAYPAL_PLAN_STARTER=
PAYPAL_PLAN_PRO=
PAYPAL_PLAN_STARTER_TRIAL=
PAYPAL_PLAN_PRO_TRIAL=
PAYPAL_CURRENCY=USD
PAYPAL_STARTER_BASE_AMOUNT=
PAYPAL_PRO_BASE_AMOUNT=
CASHFREE_ENVIRONMENT=production
CASHFREE_API_VERSION=2026-01-01
CASHFREE_CLIENT_ID=
CASHFREE_CLIENT_SECRET=
CASHFREE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# Media & SFU Configuration
SFU_PORT=4000
SFU_ANNOUNCED_IP=10.0.0.10
SFU_MIN_PORT=40000
SFU_MAX_PORT=49999
SFU_CONTROL_TOKEN=CHANGE_ME_RANDOM_CONTROL_SECRET_2026

# TURN / STUN (Coturn)
TURN_SECRET=CHANGE_ME_TURN_SECRET_2026
TURN_SERVERS=turn:10.0.0.10:3478

# MinIO (S3-compatible Object Storage for meeting recordings)
MINIO_ENDPOINT=minio
MINIO_PORT=9000
MINIO_ACCESS_KEY=qsvc_minio_admin
MINIO_SECRET_KEY=CHANGE_ME_MINIO_SECRET_2026
MINIO_BUCKET=qsvc-recordings

# MCU & FreeSWITCH Configuration (for Polycom / Cisco SIP / H.323 room systems)
MCU_ENABLED=true
POLY_BRIDGE_ENABLED=true
BRIDGE_API_TOKEN=CHANGE_ME_BRIDGE_API_TOKEN_2026
FS_ESL_HOST=127.0.0.1
FS_ESL_PORT=8021
FS_ESL_PASSWORD=ClueCon

# Multilingual AI Services (Local / Intranet MT and ASR)
CAPTION_TRANSLATION_PROVIDER=libretranslate
LIBRETRANSLATE_URL=http://mt-cpu:5000
ASR_URL=http://asr-cpu:5001/api/v1/transcribe
ENABLE_ONPREM_GOOGLE_TRANSLATION=false

# AI Meeting Minutes (Local Ollama or vLLM)
MINUTES_LLM_URL=http://ollama:11434/v1
MINUTES_LLM_MODEL=llama3:8b
MINUTES_LLM_API_KEY=none

